    The enum casts on the model become the <code>Channel</code> and{" "}
    <code>MessageStatus</code> schemas, and <code>created_at</code> becomes a
    nullable <code>date-time</code>. The <code>@example</code> values replace
    the placeholders, like <code>"string"</code>, that the response examples
    would otherwise show.
  </p>

